---
description: Preserve ProtoMolt architecture and reuse its protobuf toolkit
alwaysApply: true
---

Read root AGENTS.md, especially "Start here: reuse and scope control", before
editing or delegating. It is the canonical policy for every module.

Read docs/design/protobuf-toolkit-audit.md and relevant source-index entries.
Verify current branch and authorization. Main and ai-slop-archive-by-astra are
protected during reconciliation. Audit completion does not authorize repairs.

Use existing descriptor mapping, CEL, validation, parts and receipt machinery.
For example, inspect ProtoFieldMapper and ProtoValidator instead of converting
a typed message through JSON or Struct to manipulate or validate its fields.

Never introduce a second public document API, authoritative JSON representation,
arbitrary document ceiling or weakened validation as an implementation shortcut.
Follow AGENTS.md for design changes, evidence and worker handoffs.
